I wake up in my flat.
It is morning.
It is my second day in Copenhagen.
Today I have two things to do.
First I need to get a phone number.
And then I need to go to the kommune.
The kommune is the city's office.
I look in my bag.
I have my passport.
I also have my papers.
The papers are important.
Everything is here.
I am a little nervous.
It is a big day.
